# sweep: --bare
# An address typed with plain http is refused, and the owner is told why
# rather than seeing the field quietly go back to empty.
wait-for Connect Mealie
tap Type the address here
wait-for Kitchen Card settings
tap https://mealie.example
expect https://
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type ://mealie.invalid
expect http://mealie.invalid
tap Save
wait-for Kitchen Card settings
expect-missing http://mealie.invalid
wait-for Kitchen Card does not use plain http.
clean
shot kitchen-settings-plain-http
